## 5. Variable Dependency Map

```
   Vehicle mass (m)
        │
        ▼
   Corner load (W_static) ───► Jounce G-load (n)
        │
        ▼
   Dynamic force (F_dynamic)
        │
        ▼
   Shock angle (θ) ────────► Axial shock force (F_s)
        │
        ▼
   Hole height (H_hole) ───► Bending moment (M)
        │
        ▼
   Wall thickness (t) ─────┐
   Flange height (h) ──────┼──► Section modulus (Z)
   Clevis span (d) ────────┘
        │
        ▼
   Bending stress (σ_b) ───► Fatigue safety factor (n_f)
        │
        ▼
   Peak von Mises (FEA) ───► Redesign decision
```

Changes to any input ripple down. The redesign targets the variables
in the middle of the chain (t, R_bend, gusset geometry) because they
alter stress without affecting the vehicle interface.

