## 6. Assumptions & Justifications

| Assumption | Value | Justification |
|-----------|-------|---------------|
| Bracket depth $W_{depth}$ | 60 mm | Matches commercial weld-on tabs |
| Front lip height $H_{front}$ | 35 mm | Shock body clearance |
| Bend radius $R_{bend}$ | 4.8 mm | Press-brake DFM rule ($= t$) |
| Gusset spine width | 38.1 mm | Matches clevis span |
| Gusset spine height | 45 mm | 75% of bracket depth |
| K-factor | 0.44 | Inventor default for steel |
| Jounce G-load | 3.5 | Off-road impact per blueprint |
| Corner bias | 0.55 | Rear-axle static weight share |

Update this table any time a value changes.

